-- Repro: invalid snapshot configuration
-- Copy the idea into:
--   snapshots/snp_customers.sql
--
-- Example temporary breakage:
--   keep strategy = 'check'
--   remove unique_key or set it to an invalid value
--
-- Command:
--   dbt build --select path:snapshots/snp_customers.sql
--
-- Before:
--   Older runtimes could show long Python output during snapshot validation.
--
-- After:
--   Newer dbt/Fusion should show the relevant snapshot validation message
--   directly, without an internal traceback.
